                    {
                        "sense_id": "ca9fb764-48fd-3308-ae88-4edd03be670f",
                        "entry_id": "63943090-a594-3317-8ab5-cdb686249a3d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The state or quality of being inconsequent."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a86e114f-3ace-46dd-bc43-5e155e832fe3",
                                "sense_id": "ca9fb764-48fd-3308-ae88-4edd03be670f",
                                "text": "Quit pondering the inconsequence of being in a universe governed by chaos and just play some football."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7406a36d-1194-41ed-88e3-af7cb10e6225",
                                "sense_id": "ca9fb764-48fd-3308-ae88-4edd03be670f",
                                "text": "There, through the door and out of her life, it all went—the Lieutenant, his Laundry, his inconsequence, his habit of drinking too much, his failings, his niceness, his kissings in the dark, her little “romance” and renewed interest in life because of him, all."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a795b7d3-3be3-3ff9-abe3-4cfc040c7014",
                        "entry_id": "63943090-a594-3317-8ab5-cdb686249a3d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An inconsequent thing."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "fc69b84f-3bc7-4767-860c-ecef0eebac47",
                                "sense_id": "a795b7d3-3be3-3ff9-abe3-4cfc040c7014",
                                "text": "His voice was monotonous and jerky, but his sermons were sane, and after the bald inconsequences of Howley even eloquent."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "382e9c7b-0d4f-456d-a236-37bf501532f8",
                                "sense_id": "a795b7d3-3be3-3ff9-abe3-4cfc040c7014",
                                "text": "Only those who would view the Terror either as the last word on revolution or as an inconsequence, as more of the same, deny it any providentiality […]"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
